index=botsv3 sourcetype=aws:cloudtrail earliest=0 eventName=TerminateInstances ```list of service accounts to exclude here ex. NOT user IN (list of service accounts)```
| fields _time dest user
| bin span=10min _time as timewindow
| eventstats dc(dest) as dc_instances_thiswindow by user, timewindow
| where dc_instances_thiswindow >= 5
| stats values(dest) as dest by user